# Emptiness: the creature card returned has "mana value 3 or less". With {W}{W} spent but only an Elegy Acolyte (mana value 4)
# and an Island in the graveyard, the first ability has no legal target and is removed from the stack (CR 603.3d): nothing is
# asked, nothing returns, and the Acolyte stays in the graveyard. Positive control: the same game with a Llanowar Elves
# there, emptiness-cast-with-white-white-returns-a-creature-card-of-mana-value-three-or-less.

